adult.glb in this directory is an adapted work, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Source: Human Reference Atlas 3D reference objects (HuBMAP CCF), the Visible
Human male, release v2.0, models/3d-vh-m-united.glb.zip
(https://github.com/hubmapconsortium/ccf-releases), derived from the
National Library of Medicine's Visible Human Project. Licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://github.com/hubmapconsortium/ccf-3d-reference-object-library).

Changes: cut into one mesh per region and side as named in
src/body/regions.ts, plus one mesh each for the skin and the rest of the
skeleton; other structures (eyes, vessels, nerves, lymph node, reproductive
organs, larynx, bronchi) left out; welded, simplified with meshoptimizer,
quantised and meshopt-compressed by tools/body/build.mjs. No warranty.

The code in this repository is MIT; this licence covers only the mesh.
